tkdsts                  PROTECT                                 INPUTRI 2
tkdjenisaw         ALLCAPS SCROLL                         INPUTRI 3
tkdstr1                 PROTECT                                 INPUTRI 2
tkdket                  TEXTAREA                                INPUTRI 3
